-link\">Sovereign</a>&#039;s agenda.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Opposes:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/mass-effect/citadel/citadel-council/spectres/commander-shepard\" class=\"entity-link\">Commander Shepard</a>\n            — Shepard hunts the rogue Spectre Saren.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Member Of:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/mass-effect/citadel/citadel-council/spectres\" class=\"entity-link\">Spectres</a>\n            — Saren was a Spectre before going rogue.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/mass-effect/reapers\" class=\"entity-link\">Reapers</a>\n            — Saren Arterius is connected to <a href=\"/mass-effect/reapers\" class=\"entity-link\">Reapers</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/mass-effect/turians\" class=\"entity-link\">Turians</a>\n            — Saren Arterius is connected to <a href=\"/mass-effect/turians\" class=\"entity-link\">Turians</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/mass-effect/systems-alliance/eden-prime\" class=\"entity-link\">Eden Prime</a>\n            — <a href=\"/mass-effect/systems-alliance/eden-prime\" class=\"entity-link\">Eden Prime</a> is connected to Saren Arterius through shared lore.\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"graph-section\">\n    <h2>Mapped connections</h2>\n\n    <p class=\"section-intro\">\n        Every edge is another route through the subject. Expand a group\n        to see how these threads fit together.\n    </p>\n\n    \n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Connected To</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">3</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"topic-examples\">\n         